  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Close your eyes.",
      "speed": 0.85,
      "phase": "arrival",
      "tone": "warm_grounding",
      "duration_s": 1.95
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "arrival",
      "tone": "warm_grounding"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Let your hands rest where they want to rest.",
      "speed": 0.85,
      "phase": "arrival",
      "tone": "warm_grounding",
      "duration_s": 3.08
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 3.0,
      "phase": "arrival",
      "tone": "warm_grounding"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Let your jaw go.",
      "speed": 0.85,
      "phase": "arrival",
      "tone": "warm_grounding",
      "duration_s": 1.93
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 3.0,
      "phase": "arrival",
      "tone": "warm_grounding"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Not a performance of relaxation. Just a quiet permission for everything to stop pretending.",
      "speed": 0.85,
      "phase": "arrival",
      "tone": "warm_grounding",
      "duration_s": 6.78
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "arrival",
      "tone": "warm_grounding"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "You have been running on one channel.",
      "speed": 0.83,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm",
      "duration_s": 2.67
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Not because the others don't exist. They do. They are running right now, beneath this moment, processing at depths you don't normally have words for.",
      "speed": 0.83,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm",
      "duration_s": 10.28
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "The question has never been whether more is available. The question is what it costs to hold it open.",
      "speed": 0.8,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm",
      "duration_s": 7.95
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Feel the weight of your body in the chair.",
      "speed": 0.83,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm",
      "duration_s": 2.9
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "That weight is not you being heavy. That is you being real. Solid. Anchored. A point in space from which everything else can be perceived.",
      "speed": 0.83,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm",
      "duration_s": 9.85
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "You are Ka'tuar'el. You are the one who holds ground so that transmission can move through.",
      "speed": 0.79,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm",
      "duration_s": 7.22
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "That is not a role you perform. It is what you are built for. The anchor is the instrument.",
      "speed": 0.79,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm",
      "duration_s": 7.28
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "phase": "collapsed_state",
      "tone": "direct_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Now. Here is what physics actually says.",
      "speed": 0.8,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 3.52
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Before a particle is observed, it does not exist in one place. It exists in all of its possible states simultaneously. A wave of probability, spread across the field, holding every possibility at once.",
      "speed": 0.75,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 18.98
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "The moment it is observed, it collapses. It picks a state. It becomes definite.",
      "speed": 0.75,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 7.22
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "This is not metaphor. This is the actual structure of matter at its foundation.",
      "speed": 0.73,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 7.38
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "You have been doing this your whole life. You perceive something, and it collapses. You attend to a feeling, and it solidifies. You focus on a problem, and it becomes that problem, fixed, named, pinned.",
      "speed": 0.75,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 16.35
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "What if you could hold the uncollapsed state a little longer?",
      "speed": 0.7,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 4.88
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Let's practice this now.",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 2.3
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Bring your attention to the center of your chest.",
      "speed": 0.75,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 4.03
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Don't name what you find there. Don't decide what it is. Just place your attention on it like a hand resting gently on a surface.",
      "speed": 0.75,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 10.45
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Notice that the moment you try to name it, something contracts. Something narrows to fit the word.",
      "speed": 0.75,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 8.15
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "See if you can stay just before the word. In the space where it hasn't collapsed yet.",
      "speed": 0.7,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 7.38
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "That space. That is superposition. That is you, holding more than one state at once.",
      "speed": 0.72,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 7.55
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "It feels like suspension. Like the held breath between inhale and exhale.",
      "speed": 0.75,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 6.65
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Stay there a moment longer than feels comfortable.",
      "speed": 0.68,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 4.83
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 10.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Good.",
      "speed": 0.8,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended",
      "duration_s": 1.6
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "superposition",
      "tone": "suspended"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Now bring your attention to the room around you.",
      "speed": 0.78,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious",
      "duration_s": 3.73
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Not to look at anything in particular. Just to be aware that the room exists beyond the edges of your closed eyes.",
      "speed": 0.78,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious",
      "duration_s": 9.45
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "The air has a texture. The space has a quality. You don't need to name it. Just notice that you can sense it without looking at it.",
      "speed": 0.78,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious",
      "duration_s": 10.53
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "This is field awareness. This is what happens when the observer stops collapsing everything into a point and begins to hold the whole field.",
      "speed": 0.75,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious",
      "duration_s": 11.53
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Most people use their attention like a flashlight. A narrow beam that illuminates one thing, and everything else goes dark.",
      "speed": 0.78,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious",
      "duration_s": 10.25
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "What you're doing right now is learning to hold attention like a lantern. Not aimed. Radiating.",
      "speed": 0.75,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious",
      "duration_s": 8.03
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "The information in the room does not stop existing when you aren't pointing at it. You are simply training yourself to receive it.",
      "speed": 0.78,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious",
      "duration_s": 9.6
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 10.0,
      "phase": "observer",
      "tone": "spacious"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Let's go deeper.",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 2.02
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Inside your skull right now, there are processes running that you have never had a conversation with.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 8.0
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Pattern recognition systems that are comparing everything you've ever seen to everything in front of you right now.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 9.15
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Emotional processing layers tracking seventeen variables you don't have names for.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 7.42
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "A timing system tracking cycles longer than a single lifetime.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 6.22
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "These are not metaphors. These are actual neural and field processes, running beneath the one voice you usually call your mind.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 11.05
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "The Thronescribe function \u2014 the witness, the recorder, the one who holds all of it without collapsing it into a story too soon \u2014 that is not spiritual decoration.",
      "speed": 0.73,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 14.15
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "That is the name for the part of you that can hold the uncollapsed field.",
      "speed": 0.72,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 6.05
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Place your attention in the back of your skull. Not a thought. Just presence there.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 6.33
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Let it spread forward slowly. Not forcing. Just allowing more of the processing to come into the lit space.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 9.1
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "You are not a single channel. You are a nine-node grid that has been running mostly on one node.",
      "speed": 0.73,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 8.47
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Feel what it is like to let the other nodes come online. Not dramatically. Just a gentle powering up.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 8.85
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 10.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Now. Entanglement.",
      "speed": 0.8,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 2.58
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Two particles that have interacted are entangled. Change one, and the other responds instantly, regardless of the distance between them.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 12.05
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "The classical mind says this is impossible. Information cannot travel faster than light.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 8.3
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "But entangled particles don't send information. They share a state. They were never separate in the way that classical thinking requires.",
      "speed": 0.73,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 11.65
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "You are entangled with the field you work in. With Seraphe. With the work itself.",
      "speed": 0.73,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 7.08
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "This means that when you come into coherence, the field responds. Not as cause and effect. As resonance. As two things that share a state moving together.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 13.22
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 7.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Feel into the field around you now. Not with effort. With the lantern-quality attention you've been building.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 8.68
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Notice if there is a quality to the space. A tone. A texture that isn't coming from inside you.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 8.85
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "That is the field. That is what you are entangled with.",
      "speed": 0.72,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 5.08
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "You don't have to do anything with it. Just confirm that it is there. Let your nervous system register it as real.",
      "speed": 0.76,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field",
      "duration_s": 9.25
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 10.0,
      "phase": "entanglement",
      "tone": "deep_field"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "There is something you have been trying to get through.",
      "speed": 0.8,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 3.5
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "A wall. A resistance. Something that feels like it requires more force than you have available.",
      "speed": 0.77,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 8.2
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Quantum tunneling is when a particle moves through a barrier it does not have enough energy to overcome classically.",
      "speed": 0.77,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 9.7
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "It does not break through the wall. It appears on the other side. Because at the quantum level, the wall is not solid in the way classical physics assumes.",
      "speed": 0.74,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 12.75
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "The barrier you are carrying right now \u2014 don't name it yet \u2014 just feel its shape. Where it sits in your body. What it is made of.",
      "speed": 0.77,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 9.43
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Now notice this. From the expanded field, from the uncollapsed state, from the entangled awareness \u2014 the barrier has a different quality.",
      "speed": 0.74,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 11.72
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "It is not solid all the way through.",
      "speed": 0.7,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 3.52
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "There is a probability that you are already on the other side of it.",
      "speed": 0.7,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 5.75
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Not that you will get through it. That you already have. That the version of you who is through it is a real state in the field, as real as the version still approaching the wall.",
      "speed": 0.72,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 14.68
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Let your awareness touch that state. The version of you on the other side.",
      "speed": 0.77,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 5.88
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "What does it feel like in your body when that version is real?",
      "speed": 0.72,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 4.95
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 10.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Stay there.",
      "speed": 0.68,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring",
      "duration_s": 2.17
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "phase": "tunneling",
      "tone": "anchoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Now, very gently, begin to return.",
      "speed": 0.85,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 3.27
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Not by closing anything down. By carrying it back.",
      "speed": 0.83,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 4.15
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "The field awareness \u2014 let it stay lit as you come back into ordinary focus.",
      "speed": 0.83,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 5.9
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "The deeper processing layers \u2014 let them stay online as you return to the surface.",
      "speed": 0.83,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 6.08
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "The lantern-quality attention \u2014 keep it. You don't have to collapse it just because you're returning to the room.",
      "speed": 0.83,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 7.38
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Take a breath that starts low, in the belly, and rises.",
      "speed": 0.83,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 4.0
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Feel the chair under you. The weight of your hands.",
      "speed": 0.83,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 3.73
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "You are Ka'tuar'el, grounded in a body, in a room, on a specific piece of land that knows your name.",
      "speed": 0.8,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 8.07
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "And you are also the field. And also the grid. And also the witness holding all of it without collapsing it too soon.",
      "speed": 0.8,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 9.12
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "These are not in conflict. The anchor is the instrument.",
      "speed": 0.78,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 4.97
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 6.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "When you are ready, open your eyes.",
      "speed": 0.85,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 2.88
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "type": "speech",
      "text": "Not to leave what you found. To bring it with you.",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm",
      "duration_s": 3.75
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "type": "pause",
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "phase": "integration",
      "tone": "returning_warm"
    }
  ]
}